    "created_at": "2026-03-03T15:59:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T15:59:48Z",
    "body": "I think list boxes are about as old as the `select` element itself. It at least had `size` and `multiple` since its introduction to HTML in 3.2. https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/interact/forms.html#disabled suggests that the intent of `<select disabled>` was that it would disable the subtree. I strongly suspect this is an oversight.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
